<title>USA: Sabre Group shares grab $6 &quot;pop&quot; at open.</title>
<headline>Sabre Group shares grab $6 &quot;pop&quot; at open.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sabre Group Holdings Inc shares jumped six at their opening to 33 a share in heavy trading at their market debut on the New York Stock Exchange on Friday.</p>
<p>The stock was the second most active issue on the New York Stock Exchange immediately after its opening.</p>
</text>
